WEBVTT

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:20.120
This voice

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.250
Carbine field, Class 8!

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.620
Surface armor, activated!

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:07.730
I don't know the 3rd, 8th, and 6th blocks!

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:09.030
What's the damage?

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.800
No damage, but we can see the radiation source!

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.780
Don't be flustered. Let me tell you who's here.

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.200
Enemy fleet, free number!

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:22.300
Are all the lights of the heavens enemies?

00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.910
There's nothing they can't do.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:28.060
I'll destroy them all in space!

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:33.660
Let the train go!

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:35.520
Focus!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.010
Dimension Damage!

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:05.820
My job is to dig every day.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:12.140
If I dig a hole, the village will expand.

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:16.700
The village chief is happy to let me eat a pork mackerel steak.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.320
Digging for steak?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.950
That's not it.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.570
You can even dig up treasures.

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:41.900
Come on, dig up more!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.480
Um...

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.410
You're digging a hole, Shimon?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.830
Every day, every day, you become dirty.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.160
What's so fun about that?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:06.990
You have something weird in you.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:08.310
It's gross, isn't it?

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.310
And it stinks, too.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.690
Ah, look over here.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.480
If you don't be careful, you might dig a hole.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:27.800
Look up and walk, Shimon.

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:29.860
Ah, the hair!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.430
It's not Kaina. Call me Aniki.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.840
I don't have any siblings.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.840
That's not what I meant.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.790
The brother of the soul is the brother of the soul.

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.350
Don't worry about what an ugly woman says.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:48.140
This one suits you.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:51.220
The appeal is your soul.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:52.470
Come on.

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:57.680
Matashitama.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:58.680
How's the preparation?

00:04:59.120 --> 00:04:59.960
I don't know.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:01.620
What are you going to do?

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:02.700
Listen, Simon.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.870
Your drill is not the chief's.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.170
That is you yourself.

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:08.940
What is your drill?

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:12.370
why?

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:13.800
I understand.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.420
Don't ask me why.

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:17.300
I can't explain.

00:05:17.780 --> 00:05:19.500
Are you ready?

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:22.450
We are invincible.

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.170
No one can stop us.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:27.640
Sumiya is in a small village.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.500
Don't break it.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:30.540
These young men...

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.390
Young men aim for the ground!!

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:33.030
Don't look at me like that!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.710
There's no such thing as the Earth you're talking about!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:38.880
That's not true! I saw it!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.350
There's no walls or ceilings on the Earth!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.710
Instead, there's a shining blue sky!

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:44.930
You liar!

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:46.530
What?

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.090
Your father was just saying things like a dream.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.650
At the end of the day, he became a rock and became a beast!

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.140
My father went to the Earth! I'm going with him!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.290
Then why are you here?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:00.960
That's...

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:01.780
Listen carefully!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.870
This village is the only one we have.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:07.840
This Akazu's ceiling is said to be something that must be opened by all generations.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.570
There is no food for those who don't understand that.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.910
Put it in the cellar and get rid of the food!

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:15.890
What?

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:17.800
You didn't get it?

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:24.080
Aniki, I'm sorry.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.890
But I can't get rid of the food.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.580
Aniki, don't be so hard on yourself and apologize.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:29.880
Aniki...

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.090
Don't call me big brother. You don't have a big brother like me.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.340
It's not a big deal to be united with Grendan.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.100
Simon, come with me.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:46.780
I know that you were left behind by Kamina.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:52.350
You have a very important job, which is digging a hole in this Jihamura.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:55.880
You don't have to fight an idiot, so come with me.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:57.300
But...

00:07:57.300 --> 00:07:57.990
Let's go.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.060
Don't worry about it. Go.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:22.880
I'm not running away!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.780
That's right, you're...

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.230
Don't worry, it'll be over soon.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:44.840
Every single day, every single day,

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:46.910
I'm scared of the earthquake like this,

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.260
and there's no ceiling on the ground!

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.790
Cut it out!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.900
It's not that I've been taking care of a child without parents!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.270
It's because I'm the village chief!

00:08:58.900 --> 00:08:59.920
I have this...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.700
I have a duty to protect this village and the villagers.

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:05.270
But the one who doesn't listen to me is not in this village!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:14.110
What are you doing here?

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.090
Hehe.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.950
All right, all right.

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.540
The food for the emergency is secured.

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:25.280
My parents died in an earthquake.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.760
It was 7 o'clock.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.690
No matter how many holes I dig like this...

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:35.930
One day, me, the village chief, and everyone in the village will fall to the ground and be crushed to death.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.040
That's the final decision.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.510
That's the final decision?

00:09:41.610 --> 00:09:42.010
Ah!

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:03.640
It's time to go to bed! Everyone in the village, go to bed now!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.060
Don't waste your precious electricity!

00:10:07.490 --> 00:10:10.080
Get bigger! Get bigger!

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:12.650
Get bigger and become a steak!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:14.400
What?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:22.180
Simon? What's wrong?

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:23.860
Come here! There's something I want to show you!

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:24.700
Huh?

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.640
But...

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.370
Look! It's a escape!

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:32.610
If the village chief finds out, it won't be easy, right, Shimon?

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.180
I wasn't thinking that much because I was so absorbed in it.

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.100
Well, if you go back in the morning, you won't find out.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:43.640
So, what do you want to show that much? What can you see?

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.740
It's my face! It's a really big face!

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:53.130
You have the guts to escape, Kamina.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.600
Shimon, is this your big face?

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.340
Don't look down on me!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.680
I'm the village chief, so I'll keep an eye on you.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.020
Shimo!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.000
You too!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:06.090
I know you're hiding and digging a hole.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:08.370
Stop it!

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:09.840
It's not his fault.

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.180
I'm the bad guy.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.460
I know you're the bad guy!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:05.270
It's up there!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:11.040
I knew the ground was up there!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.230
This huge thing fell from the ground!

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.920
Isn't that right, captain?!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:37.650
You're not the one who's gonna protect this village, are you?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.710
I don't know which one of us is lying.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.520
It's here!

00:12:46.800 --> 00:12:46.980
Oh!

00:12:51.140 --> 00:12:51.880
Get into that village!

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.510
I want to have a good time!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.820
I will not allow you to do anything more than that!

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:04.040
Mm...

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.930
That's right!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.740
Don't you dare say that!

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:15.120
Grendam, who is bewitching Jin Hamura!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.980
Carry the soul of a man on your back!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.800
Fu-Tou Kitsutou!

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.060
Oh, big brother!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:23.440
God!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:24.890
It's me!

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:28.220
I'm an idiot.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.540
You're such an idiot.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:34.340
In this village, no more sorcery is allowed!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.740
This god is unforgivable!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:41.970
What are you doing?

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:42.950
Huh?

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:44.560
Yes!

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:01.700
From the ground again?

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:02.940
This time, it's a woman.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:03.660
Huh?

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:15.520
Vittel, Kake, let's get out of here!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.020
Yo, Bepin-san!

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:17.580
Huh?

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.080
Are you fighting with him?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:20.400
That was good.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:20.900
What?

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.470
You came from the ground, didn't you?

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:24.300
Well, yeah.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:24.900
You're good.

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:27.280
Is that a ground weapon, too?

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:29.300
It's a little different, but it's that kind of thing.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.120
Nice body!

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:33.300
Women on the ground are different!

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.490
I've told you many times, get out of here!

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.440
Do you want to die?

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:47.680
Thank you, Simon. You saved us.

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:49.020
Hurry, this way!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:50.280
Where are we?

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.130
The Shifa Village.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.790
Then, the next village...

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:53.230
Next?

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.570
I came from the Rittner Village in the next village.

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:59.710
What? You said you came from the ground, but you're from the cave!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.890
It's only on the ground, but the source is...

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:04.560
Are you from the underground?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.070
Get out of my way!

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:07.570
What's the difference in your attitude?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:09.690
It's this way.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:11.860
What's this? Where are you from?

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:12.560
Gao.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:17.050
What's with the mask?

00:15:17.370 --> 00:15:18.360
It's strong.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:23.640
I can aim at the transmitter.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:26.340
If I do that, I can stop the movement.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:31.990
I'm going to kill you!

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:47.010
Don't talk about this fight with a woman!

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:48.220
It's a fight!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.190
I told you, woman!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:56.000
Aiko!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.830
What I wanted to show you...

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:58.090
Yeah?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.660
This is another amazing...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.520
This is easy to dig.

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.840
Is this also a friend of the face on the top?

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:07.630
It's smaller than the one on the top, but it's a good posture.

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:09.120
But look!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.980
Is it possible for someone to ride it?

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:12.790
Can you ride it?

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:15.070
Big brother! With this, he will...

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.840
I'll beat that big head!

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.000
With this?

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:20.840
That's right!

00:16:20.940 --> 00:16:22.170
Big brother, with this...

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:22.670
Look!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:34.160
You do it, Shimon.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.060
You're the one who started it.

00:16:36.360 --> 00:16:37.700
This is yours.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:40.380
You think you can seduce your little brother?

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:42.540
What?

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:46.070
I can't do it!

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:48.020
Shut up!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.550
You're going to kick him out of the street!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:53.700
That's how we do it!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:55.420
But...

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:07.850
Hey! You can do it!

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:08.990
Uwaaaah!

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:12.280
Listen, Simon! Don't believe in yourself!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:12.660
Huh?

00:17:12.820 --> 00:17:15.880
Believe in me! Believe in yourself! Believe in me!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.460
What's that?

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:21.160
Demir!

00:18:34.284 --> 00:18:34.784
See ya!

00:18:35.148 --> 00:18:37.148
I'm the one who made the decision!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:00.650
Simon!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:02.530
It's a bit too small...

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.130
Well, we got him anyway.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.010
So it was a dead end.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:09.270
Huh?

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:24.380
Ryo!

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:45.760
He said something.

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:48.640
You're the one!

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.300
I think I can do it.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:52.780
Alright!

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:55.700
I'll hit him in the face!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.340
And I'll show you the power of Grendan's drill!

00:20:59.260 --> 00:20:59.520
Yeah!

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:08.160
Drill!

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:32.750
You're Chijou, aren't you?

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:51.980
You haven't told me my name yet, have you?

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:53.500
Come to think of it...

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:54.800
I'm Kaminato.

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.340
I'm Simon.

00:22:56.540 --> 00:22:57.740
Nice to meet you.

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:00.330
What is this

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:00.430
ah

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:36.810
Welcome to the washroom.

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:38.760
Really?

00:23:39.220 --> 00:23:42.730
I'm sorry.

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:53.550
It's been a year, and it's been a year again.
